    "preview": "#ffe8b6",
    "theme": "gold",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nI think your smile deserves its own paragraph.\n\nThere is something about seeing you smile that makes everything feel lighter. For {years}, I have noticed how easily you can turn an ordinary moment into a good one.\n\nMaybe you don't realize how much that means.\n\nI hope I can become someone who gives you reasons to smile too.\n\nI care about you more than I can fit into one little letter, but I hope these words are enough to help you understand.\n\nWould you let me try?\n\n{yourName} 😊❤️"
