    "preview": "#e1d4ff",
    "theme": "purple",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nThere are probably a thousand thoughts I could write here, but they all seem to lead back to the same person: you.\n\nFor {years}, you have appeared in my thoughts during the most random moments. A song, a place, a joke, or even something completely ordinary can remind me of you.\n\nThat is when I realized you are not just a passing thought anymore. You have become a meaningful part of my life.\n\nI hope I can become a meaningful part of yours too.\n\nWith all my thoughts,\n{yourName} 💭💕"
