    "preview": "#d8f5ff",
    "theme": "blue",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nWriting this takes a little courage because telling someone how you feel can be scary.\n\nBut after {years}, I decided that some feelings are worth being honest about.\n\nI care about you. I enjoy being around you. I appreciate the little things about you that make you different from everyone else.\n\nI don't know what your answer will be, and that's okay. I just wanted to be brave enough to tell you the truth.\n\nMaybe this can be the beginning of something wonderful.\n\n{yourName} 🦋❤️"
