    "icon": "🌼",
    "preview": "#fff0c7",
    "theme": "gold",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nIt isn't one huge thing that made me care about you. It is all the little things.\n\nThe way you talk. The way you laugh. The way you treat people. The little moments that probably don't seem important to you but somehow stay in my mind.\n\nFor {years}, those little things have added up to something much bigger.\n\nThey made me realize just how special you are to me.\n\nI hope I can spend more time discovering all those little things that make you who you are.\n\n{yourName} 🌼💕"
