    "icon": "🌺",
    "preview": "#ffd8e5",
    "theme": "rose",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nFeelings are a little like flowers. They begin quietly, need time to grow, and become beautiful when cared for.\n\nFor {years}, something inside me has been growing whenever I think about you.\n\nEvery conversation has felt like another little flower, every memory another color in the garden.\n\nNow I finally have the courage to show you the garden I have been carrying in my heart.\n\nYou are very special to me, and I hope we can let something beautiful grow between us.\n\n{yourName} 🌺"
  },
