    "icon": "📝",
    "preview": "#ffdede",
    "theme": "red",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nI have rewritten this message in my head so many times, trying to find the perfect words.\n\nBut maybe there are no perfect words.\n\nSo I will simply say what I feel.\n\nFor {years}, you have become someone I genuinely care about. You make me smile, you make ordinary moments memorable, and you have a place in my thoughts that nobody else has.\n\nI hope these imperfect words are enough to tell you something very real.\n\nI like you, {name}. ❤️\n\n{yourName}"
  },
