    "preview": "#d8f5d8",
    "theme": "green",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nSometimes the best things in life are the things we never planned.\n\nMeeting you feels like one of those beautiful surprises.\n\nFor {years}, our connection has grown through little conversations, shared moments, and memories I genuinely treasure.\n\nI never expected someone to become this important to me, but I am grateful that it happened.\n\nMaybe the next beautiful surprise could be discovering what we might become together.\n\nWith a grateful heart,\n{yourName} 🍀❤️"
