    "theme": "blue",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nSome days are ordinary. Some are difficult. And then there are days when you appear and somehow everything feels a little better.\n\nFor {years}, I have noticed how much happier I feel when I get to spend time with you or even have a simple conversation.\n\nYou have a way of making ordinary moments feel brighter.\n\nI hope someday I can do the same for you.\n\nWould you let me try?\n\n{yourName} 🌈💕"
