    "icon": "🩷",
    "preview": "#ffe3ee",
    "theme": "pink",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nI don't want to make this complicated.\n\nI simply want you to know that you are someone I care about deeply.\n\nFor {years}, my feelings have quietly grown, and every little memory seems to make them stronger.\n\nYou have become a person I genuinely enjoy having in my life, and I hope you understand how special that is to me.\n\nThere is no pressure and no perfect answer needed. I just wanted to share something honest from my heart.\n\nYou mean a lot to me.\n\n{yourName} 🩷"
  },
