    "category": "Adventure",
    "icon": "🗺️",
    "preview": "#d9f0ff",
    "theme": "blue",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nLife is an adventure full of places we haven't seen, things we haven't tried, and memories we haven't made yet.\n\nFor {years}, I have been lucky enough to have you as part of my journey.\n\nNow I find myself hoping that some of the adventures still waiting for us could be shared together.\n\nIt doesn't have to be anything extraordinary. Even a simple day can become a great memory when you are with the right person.\n\nWould you like to take the next little adventure with me?\n\n{yourName} 🗺️❤️"
