    "icon": "💡",
    "preview": "#fff1c9",
    "theme": "gold",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nI don't remember one exact moment when everything changed.\n\nMaybe it happened through hundreds of small moments.\n\nSomewhere during the past {years}, I realized that I cared about you differently. Your happiness started mattering to me. Your smile became something I looked forward to. Your presence became something I appreciated more than I could explain.\n\nThat realization stayed with me.\n\nAnd today, I finally have the courage to tell you.\n\nI really like you.\n\n{yourName} 💕"
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "name": "A Thousand Smiles",
    "category": "Cute",
    "icon": "😄",
    "preview": "#ffe7c7",
    "theme": "peach",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nI could probably count a thousand little reasons why you make me smile.\n\nMaybe it is something you say. Maybe it is your laugh. Maybe it is simply seeing you having a good day.\n\nFor {years}, you have given me more happy moments than you probably realize.\n\nI want to give some of those smiles back.\n\nSo here is my little confession: I care about you more than I planned to, and I would love to see where that feeling takes us.\n\nKeep smiling,\n{yourName} 😄❤️"
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "name": "The Long Letter",
    "category": "Long",
    "icon": "💌",
    "preview": "#ffd4e5",
    "theme": "pink",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nI wanted to write something that could properly explain what you mean to me, even though I know words can never completely capture a feeling.\n\nOver {years}, you have become someone I genuinely appreciate. There are so many little things about you that I admire, from the way you make people feel comfortable to the way you can turn an ordinary moment into something memorable.\n\nI treasure the conversations we have had and the memories we have created. I also find myself hoping for more moments like those in the future.\n\nI don't know what happens next, and I don't want to pretend that I do. But I do know that I would be happy if the next part of my story included more of you.\n\nThank you for simply being yourself.\n\nWith all my heart,\n{yourName} ❤️"
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "name": "Simple Happiness",
    "category": "Simple",
    "icon": "🌻",
    "preview": "#fff2a8",
    "theme": "gold",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nHappiness doesn't always need to be something huge.\n\nSometimes happiness is a good conversation, a shared laugh, a familiar smile, or simply knowing someone special is nearby.\n\nFor {years}, you have been one of those little sources of happiness in my life.\n\nI hope we can create many more simple, happy moments together.\n\nThat is all I really want: something genuine, comfortable, and full of good memories.\n\nWould you like that too?\n\n{yourName} 🌻💕"
  },
