    "icon": "🌠",
    "preview": "#d8d2ff",
    "theme": "purple",
    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nIf I could make one wish about the future, it wouldn't be for something expensive or extraordinary.\n\nI would wish for more time with people who make life meaningful.\n\nAnd you would be one of those people.\n\nFor {years}, you have become someone I deeply appreciate. I wish for more conversations, more laughter, more memories, and more opportunities to know you better.\n\nMaybe this little letter can be the beginning of that wish coming true.\n\n{yourName} 🌠❤️"
  },
