    "text": "Dear {name},\n\nSome of life's best surprises are the ones we never saw coming.\n\nMeeting you was one of mine.\n\nFor {years}, you have slowly become someone I care about more than I expected. What started as ordinary moments turned into memories that I now treasure.\n\nI am grateful that life brought you into my story.\n\nAnd now I have one little hope: that maybe you will choose to stay in the next chapters too.\n\nWould you?\n\n{yourName} 🎁❤️"
